  "question": {
    "text": "In an arithmetic progression&nbsp;containing <math><mn>99</mn></math> terms, the sum of all the odd numbered terms is <math><mn>2550</mn><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;If the sum of all the <math><mn>99</mn></math> terms of the arithmetic progression&nbsp;is <math><mi>k</mi></math>, then <math><mfrac><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>100</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> is equal to",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "50.49",
  "solution": {
    "text": "Let the terms of AP be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>d</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>98</mn><mi>d</mi></math><br />For sum of all odd numbered terms&nbsp;<math><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>d</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn><mo>.</mo></math><br />i.e.&nbsp;<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>50</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>49</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2550</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>49</mn><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2550</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>50</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>51</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>98</mn><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>102</mn></math><br />Sum of all <math><mn>99</mn></math> terms is,<br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mn>99</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>98</mn><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>99</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>102</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>99</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>51</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5049</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mi>k</mi><mn>100</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>50.49</mn></math>",
